        "staminaCost": 15,
        "description": "Roll a salt fog in over your target, blinding and drenching it. The fog hangs there for a few turns: enemies inside are soaked, can barely see to aim and keep losing sight of you; your own side in it is hidden and hard to hit, and your skin crusts with brine that bites back.",
